  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4902.05 Heating oil",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4902.05 “Heating oil” means any liquid fuel specifically designed to be used in any heating equipment system, domestic hot water heating system or appliance.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06; ss by #9766-A, eff 8-3-10 (from Saf-C 4902.05)",
